# Contract v1.3: the composition shows only in the panel's input line (pinyin with syllable spaces, a draft as
# "improve › ok"), never as marked text in the field; the field gets text only on commit.
# Owner decision 2026-11-15: switching to another input source (ABC) mid-composition is leaving: nothing of the
# pinyin stays (not committed, not marked), and the panel is hidden. (Our own Shift / Caps Lock switch still puts the
# letters in as typed: 41, 42.)
NAME switching to ABC mid-composition leaves nothing of the pinyin and hides its panel
PROFILES all
LANG chinese
TEXT "Hi |"
TYPE nihao
EXPECT marked none
EXPECT preedit "ni hao"
SWITCH abc
EXPECT doc "Hi |"
EXPECT marked none
EXPECT preedit none
EXPECT panel hidden
EXPECT nolost
